 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Seventy-four of the sons of Hodaviah",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Returned from Babylon under the sky",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With Zerubbabel and Joshua we came",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To rebuild the house of the Lord",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Kadmiel with his sons stood together",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To oversee those working on the holy place",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The foundation laid with care and reverence",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Priests in vestments with trumpets raised",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stand up and bless the LORD your God",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From everlasting to everlasting",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed be your glorious name",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Which is exalted above every praise",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On the platform of the Levites",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Kadmiel cried out with a loud voice",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We recalled the sins of our fathers",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the history of our days",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
